<title>UK: J.P. Morgan leads $925 mln asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan leads $925 mln asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBNA Master Credit Card Series 1996-J has launched an asset-backed FRN for a total of $925 million, lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities said.</p>
<p>Tranche A totals $850 million, and tranche B $75 million.</p>
<p>Both have a legal maturity of February 15 2006, with an expected maturity of September 15 2003.</p>
<p>The tranches will be priced later with coupons based on one-month Libor.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
